{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>A droving, a droving, by itself.</b> Each kind by itself." "<b>Pass on before.</b> The distance of a day or less, and I will come after you." "<b>And a space you shall put.</b> One flock in front of another within eyeshot, in order to satisfy the eye of that wicked man and to make him imagine a great abundance of gift."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:43.680207171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}